{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Wallet Extensions","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/WalletExtensionsGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Allow cardholders to provision cards directly from the Apple Wallet app.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/NetworkTokenProvisioningGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/ManualIntegration","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/SecurityGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/AdditionalResources"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In addition to in-app provisioning, you can let cardholders add their payment cards from the Apple Wallet app itself. When configured, your app’s name and icon appear in Wallet’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From Apps on Your iPhone"}]},{"text":" section, giving users another path to provision their cards.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This requires two app extensions:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Extension"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-UI Extension"}]}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provides card data, status, and handles the provisioning flow"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"UI Extension","type":"text"}]}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presents your custom authentication UI before provisioning"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK provides two base classes that handle the complexity of communicating with Apple Wallet. You subclass them and provide your app-specific logic.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before implementing wallet extensions:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/GettingStarted","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" guide and have in-app provisioning working."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure you have the "},{"code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement. This entitlement must be added to ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"all three targets","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the main app, the Non-UI Extension, and the UI Extension.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set up a shared keychain access group so the main app and extensions can share cached data.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Step-1-Create-the-Non-UI-Extension-Target","text":"Step 1: Create the Non-UI Extension Target","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, go to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Target","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{